<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEIPZIG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LEIPZIG, Germany 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Leipzig women's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix numbers</p>
<p>denote seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>2-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Miriam Oremans</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Quarter finals:</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Judith Wiesner (Austria) 1-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Add Quarter-finals:</p>
<p>4-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 6-Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>5-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>6-1</p>
</text>
